{
  "__doc": "M4 mechanism graph - direction-only causal edges (PHYSICS_ONTOLOGY_SETUP.md section 4). dir: '+' source up -> target up, '-' source up -> target down, 'u' non-monotone (an assertion, not 'unknown'). Edges are DECLARED knowledge, owner-reviewed 2026-08-14; equations (form) absent by design - direction alone is enough for the explanation gate. The 'signatures' blocks are human documentation (spatial pattern each cause tends to leave, keyed to the three map frames); the loader ignores them. Consumer: the three-gate ranking's mechanism gate (factor -> finding reachability) and the structure view's mechanism layer.",
